                                "sense_id": "346c4ad9-188f-34da-8405-a326577adb3a",
                                "text": "[…], slopehead,. whiteback, thunder duck, and gourmet's delight have been used to characterize the canvasback which has been described as the gold standard by which other species are compared ."
