                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd0383c0-99ef-4d20-bd9d-495533a6c072",
                                "sense_id": "4073c3d4-5a87-3a95-8b57-1e03d9d2accd",
                                "text": "The creation of managed habitats shows that most duck species will take to them, the main exceptions being the Pygmy Goose and the Whiteback Duck."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d534d634-1db1-3c4b-ac59-723f0bab5174",
                        "entry_id": "22f970bd-9d4f-3fd4-b732-9ce1920b7ac0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Various species that have a white back, including:",
                            "The white-backed griffon vulture (Gyps africanus)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15be5cb6-30fb-49d5-9316-857520a6249a",
                                "sense_id": "d534d634-1db1-3c4b-ac59-723f0bab5174",
                                "text": "One snake-necked Whiteback teeters on the head then, steady, dips into the socket."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48df0f05-17c4-42af-a060-f709c66f854c",
                                "sense_id": "d534d634-1db1-3c4b-ac59-723f0bab5174",
                                "text": "The whiteback is a close relative of a vulture you may have seen in Africa."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aeb82c4c-2a06-4819-806e-136934b401fd",
                                "sense_id": "d534d634-1db1-3c4b-ac59-723f0bab5174",
                                "text": "The grass rippled and whispered, a mystery on this windless day, and an uneasieness settled over me as the whitebacks rose clumsily into the air, abandoning their carrion."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ad4c095f-1c6b-3182-a330-8b000cb37d24",
                        "entry_id": "22f970bd-9d4f-3fd4-b732-9ce1920b7ac0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Various species that have a white back, including:",
                            "A Lithuanian breed of cattle, (Lietuvos baltnugariai galvijai)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee22772c-a360-4c24-9164-d1b849e53dda",
                                "sense_id": "ad4c095f-1c6b-3182-a330-8b000cb37d24",
                                "text": "In the early 20th centruy the number of white-backs was fairly large, though not recognized as a bree, these Baltic landrace cattle accounted for about 10% of the national herd."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "420fc726-abb2-3554-94e3-dd73eabfce89",
                        "entry_id": "22f970bd-9d4f-3fd4-b732-9ce1920b7ac0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of paperboard used in packaging that has a smooth white surface on one side and a brown or unbleached surface on the other side."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f450c68-cfaa-41f7-b39c-ef621ff28bfc",
                                "sense_id": "420fc726-abb2-3554-94e3-dd73eabfce89",
                                "text": "Overall, the downgrading has favored FBB and, in particular, whiteback folding boxboard, which can offer a very good whiteness and therefore good print qualities compared with SBB ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0370f3ec-2f6b-4839-ab9d-6f4aedf4e6d0",
                                "sense_id": "420fc726-abb2-3554-94e3-dd73eabfce89",
                                "text": "It will give Amcor Cartonboard the ability to produce superior quality whiteback board to that currently made at Petrie, opening up new market opportunities for the company."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4aff55e9-0122-4926-91a4-19cc63663b43",
                                "sense_id": "420fc726-abb2-3554-94e3-dd73eabfce89",
                                "text": "It produces grayback and whiteback coated duplex of 250-400 gsm."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "acda34a4-a83c-3668-9bbd-9e3186fdc1bf",
                        "entry_id": "22f970bd-9d4f-3fd4-b732-9ce1920b7ac0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A type of denim that is indigo on one side, and pale on the back."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "baac7008-c74b-43c3-a9f9-7190254e3254",
                                "sense_id": "acda34a4-a83c-3668-9bbd-9e3186fdc1bf",
                                "text": "The whiteback navy jeans were selected most often;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3dad43ec-4470-4bb1-b090-b8fe3dbacb84",
                                "sense_id": "acda34a4-a83c-3668-9bbd-9e3186fdc1bf",
                                "text": "Of heavy-weight, 111/4-oz. whiteback denim, with the fabric strengthened with 25 percent DuPont 420 nylon, the jeans will not wear or wash white, the company said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7dc611e0-4e57-4dbe-8546-6ff31fc8d313",
                                "sense_id": "acda34a4-a83c-3668-9bbd-9e3186fdc1bf",
                                "text": "Vat-dyed whiteback denim stays colorfast ."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
